    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yakobo kūmanhya na Esau",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yakobo aho wabūūcha a miso, ūmona ū Esau aliza na a banhū bakwe abo magana anè. Ūbagaba a baana bakwe kūlenganīla nū mumo baalī a bake bakwe, a ba Leya, nū Laheli, na a bakīma a basese. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bake a basese na a baana babo ūbatonja kū būtongi, hanuma wiza ū Leya na a baana bakwe; ū kū numa ūbiza ū Laheli nū Yosefu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū wei ūtongela ū kū būtongi wa bose; wandya kūshimīza ajile kūmanhya nū nkūlūye, kūnū akwinamaga ha sī kūshisha ng'hangala mpungatī, alīng'wegeela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Esau ūpeela nhambo alīnsūng'wanha ū Yakobo, ūshikīla kūng'witūla mu shikuba, ūnkumbatīla kūnū alīmbipa. A bose būbīlī wabo būlīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Esau wahayūbūūcha a miso ūbabona a bakīma na a baana; ūbūja, “Aba ūlīnabo benaba banani?” Ū Yakobo ūshosha, “A benaba baana bane nene nsese wako, abo Mulungu waninha kūlwa kūnichīla shigongo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a bakīma na a baana babo begeela kūngīsha, būtonga a basese na a baana babo, būshika binama kūshisha ha sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūkūūbīja Leya na baana bakwe, nang'hwe winama; hūna wiza nū Yosefu nū Laheli, nabo binama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya yenīyo ū Esau ūbūja gīkī, “Ūlī na makūlū kī ū mu madaale gose ayo namanhyaga nago mu nzīla?” Nang'hwe ūhaya, “Nalīkwinha kūlwa kūnichīla shigongo; na kūnanukūla baba ntaale wane.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Esau ūhaya, “Bebe nzuna wane, ū nene nalī nasho shingī no sha kūnigela. Ī shikolo shako ikalaga nasho bebe shikūkūgunanha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yakobo ūhaya, “Yaya gete, nalīkūlomba ūshisole ūlū ūlīnanukūla mu būyegi. Ī lyenīlo inong'ho lyane lyanukūlage; nguno ū kūbūbona ū būshū wako īlī gītī kūbona būshū bo ng'wa Mulungu, īkī wananukūlaga mu būyegi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalīkūlomba wanukūle ī shakwinha īsho wenhelagwa; nguno ū Mulungu wanīītīla yawiza no ū nene, kūshisha nalī na shiigunaanīlo sha kūniigela.” Ū Yakobo ūng'wikūmbīlīja no ū Esau, kūshisha ūshanukūla.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho ū Esau ūhaya, “Tūjagi lūūlū, naje nūkūtonga nī nzīla.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yakobo ūng'wīla, “Baba nkūjiwa, ūlībabona a banīgīnī benaba gīkī bataalī bado, hama ūmanile nī gīkī īlī chiza najiswage bo kūjilang'hana ī ng'holo nī ng'ombe ījo jilī na baana. Nguno ū kūjikiling'himya lūshikū lūmò jikūcha ī ndīlanha, na a baana ba ng'holo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū nalīkūlomba baba nkūjiwa ūtonge dūhū, ūnileke ū nene nsese wako nakūjaga hado hado nago a madaale, na a banīgīnī abo nalī nabo; kūshisha nane nakūshika dūhū ī Seili, ū kūlī ntaale wane ū baba.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yakobo kūja Shekemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Esau ūhaya hangī gīkī, “Nakūlekele lūūlū nahene nūūlū bamò ba banhū abo balī hamò nane aba.” Ū Yakobo ūnshokeja, “Nibūlī kwīta gīko; ū ntaale wane ū baba, ka ni wananukūla dūhū ūmo nalī chenīkī!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Esau ūnyamuka lūshikū lwenūlo, wandya lūgendo lwa kūshoka Seili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yakobo ū ng'wene ūbūūcha lūgendo lwa kūja Sukoti; aho washika ko ūtūūla ng'hambī, ūbeeja maheema kūlwakwe, na ngūtū ja kūlaala mitugo. H'ī nguno yene ī lipandī lyenīlo līkitanagwa Sukoti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yakobo aho washoka kūfuma ī Padani-alamu, akashika ū mu sī ya Kanaani alī mhola no; ūja kū nzengo gwa Shekemu, ūkatūūla ng'hambī yakwe bbihī nū nzengo gwenūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūgūla itogolo lya sī kūfuma kū bitūnja ba ng'wa Hamoli, ise wa ng'wa Shekemu. Ī litogolo lyenīlo ūlīfunīja shipande igana sha feza, ūkoma ho iheema lyakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbeeja ho na ng'walīlo ūgwitana “Mulungu, Mulungu wa Isilaeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33:20",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mulungu, Mulungu wa Isilaeli:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Shihebulania, El Elohe Isilaeli.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
